<title>USA: ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Demand moderate to light. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-2   230-260 lbs.  55.00-56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 lbs.  54.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00, instances 2.00 lower with the decline on weights over 500 lbs. Top 49.00. US 1-3   300-500 lbs. 42.00-46.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs. 46.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.00-49.00</p>
</text>
